python3-pyfasm64 (0.1.1-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Release PyFASM64 0.1.1 on PyPI as pyfasm64.
  * Added pyfasm64 and pyfasm entry points and aliases for 100% backward compatibility.
  * Full support for CPython 3.8-3.16, Free-Threaded No-GIL (3.13t-3.16t), and PyPy.
  * Preserved full compatibility with python3-pyfasm package via Provides/Replaces.

